        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added firefox support for <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;input type=\"color\" /&gt;</code> to accept any CSS color value</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>tested with <a href=\"https://codepen.io/CodeRedDigital/pen/azvQGxm\" rel=\"nofollow\">this code pen</a> in:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Nightly 144.0a1</li>\n<li>Firefox Developer Edition 143</li>\n<li>Firefox Beta 143</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40778\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40778/hovercard\">MDN Issue #40778</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41086\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41086/hovercard\">Content PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41087\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41087/hovercard\">FF Release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27814",
            "title": "added firefox support for any color value for input element",
