        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Reverts <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3375273909\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27733\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27733/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27733\">#27733</a><br>\nMy fault. I didn't see that this comes via a mixin.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If it had spec_urls I would have seen this.</p>",
