        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">We didn't see this earlier because the specification only included this recently (as of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2401103921\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/whatwg/notifications/issues/213\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/whatwg/notifications/pull/213/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/whatwg/notifications/pull/213\">whatwg/notifications#213</a>).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of Declarative Web Push.<br>\n<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-18_4-release-notes#Web-API\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-18_4-release-notes#Web-API</a></p>",
