        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87750369?u=ccc1f52005708ae16bcb50e325e02145bff0ef7d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>related PR <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1788269318\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/20294\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/20294/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/20294\">#20294</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There is an unwanted <code class=\"notranslate\">s</code> in the <code class=\"notranslate\">fenced-frame</code> value.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The following sources mentioned in the PR adding the feature do not use plural form of <code class=\"notranslate\">fenced-frame</code>:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/fenced-frame/#supports-loading-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wicg.github.io/fenced-frame/#supports-loading-mode</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://privacysandbox.google.com/private-advertising/fenced-frame\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://privacysandbox.google.com/private-advertising/fenced-frame</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1r27C2_yV8jb7N4-7MxLMHWCx9wHHaCw9HbBDcTyPnZs/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.frl8u3cowbcx\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1r27C2_yV8jb7N4-7MxLMHWCx9wHHaCw9HbBDcTyPnZs/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.frl8u3cowbcx</a></li>\n<li></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41081/files#r2334974092\">https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41081/files#r2334974092</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27811",
            "title": "Fix a typo in http.headers.Supports-Loading-Mode.json",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-10T08:14:37.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-10T08:09:32.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "OnkarRuikar",
                "url": "https://github.com/OnkarRuikar"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179191?u=8dd92441fba3cb438759ee98862670ba56f2c67d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR updates and corrects version values for Safari (Desktop and iOS/iPadOS) for the <code class=\"notranslate\">permission_push</code> member of the <code class=\"notranslate\">Permissions</code> API. The data comes from the <a href=\"https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">mdn-bcd-collector</a> project (v10.14.1).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>Check out the <a href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector#reviewing-bcd-changes\">collector's guide on how to review this PR</a>.</em></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tests Used: <a href=\"https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/api/Permissions/permission_push\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/api/Permissions/permission_push</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27796",
            "title": "Update Safari data for api.Permissions.permission_push",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-09T06:59:55.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-09T06:59:21.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "queengooborg",
                "url": "https://github.com/queengooborg"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179191?u=8dd92441fba3cb438759ee98862670ba56f2c67d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR updates and corrects version values for Safari (Desktop and iOS/iPadOS) for the <code class=\"notranslate\">permission_screen-wake-lock</code> member of the <code class=\"notranslate\">Permissions</code> API. The data comes from the <a href=\"https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">mdn-bcd-collector</a> project (v10.14.1).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>Check out the <a href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector#reviewing-bcd-changes\">collector's guide on how to review this PR</a>.</em></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tests Used: <a href=\"https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/api/Permissions/permission_screen-wake-lock\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/api/Permissions/permission_screen-wake-lock</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27795",
            "title": "Update Safari data for api.Permissions.permission_screen-wake-lock",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-09T06:59:10.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-09T06:58:26.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "queengooborg",
                "url": "https://github.com/queengooborg"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179191?u=8dd92441fba3cb438759ee98862670ba56f2c67d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR removes the <code class=\"notranslate\">permission_compute-pressure</code> member of the <code class=\"notranslate\">Permissions</code> API from BCD. The feature is not supported in any browsers, which has been confirmed by the mdn-bcd-collector.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tests Used: <a href=\"https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/api/Permissions/permission_compute-pressure\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/api/Permissions/permission_compute-pressure</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Additional Notes: Source Code: <a href=\"https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/modules/permissions/permission_descriptor.idl;drc=a9d4580fce10260f5c0d3e3b6a0f286f6d282d5c\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/modules/permissions/permission_descriptor.idl;drc=a9d4580fce10260f5c0d3e3b6a0f286f6d282d5c</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27794",
            "title": "Remove api.Permissions.permission_compute-pressure from BCD",
