        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add details of support for <code class=\"notranslate\">getBytesInUse()</code> supported in <code class=\"notranslate\">local</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">managed</code> storage. Addresses the dev-docs-needed requirements of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1385832\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1385832</a> getBytesInUse() is not supported in <code class=\"notranslate\">local</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">managed</code> storage areas</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Release note in TBD</p>",
